    "text": "By Joaquin Duncan ,\n1 days ago\nSAN DIEGO (KUSI) – The Lions and Bucs square off in Holiday Classic tournament action.\nClay Grebing leads Mission Bay with 15 points, while JSerra’s Jaden Bailes and Micah Cunningham score 14 points each as the Lions move on to the National Division final with the win.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to FOX 5 San Diego & KUSI News.",
